<h2>The case in one view</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Case</th><td>Ali Khan v. State of NCT of Delhi, CRL.A. 1012/2025</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Court</th><td>High Court of Delhi, Madhu Jain J</td></tr>
  <tr><th>Decided</th><td>3 November 2026 (reserved 27 October 2026)</td></tr>
